{"id":"1d6c15c26e749c29127a44bf2e2db834e860815e","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1244281","title":"20x 订阅里的 gpt-6-sol 额度大砍到 1200 刀了？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"bixinhaner","excerpt":"OpenAI - @bixinhaner - 生产环境今天（ 9 月 23 日） 09:00—15:43 ，北京时间：周额度已用从 59% 升至 69%，最新剩余约 31%；业务预估价值合计 $119.01 。我统计了大半天的 token","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>生产环境今天（ 9 月 23 日） 09:00—15:43 ，北京时间：周额度已用从 59% 升至 69%，最新剩余约 31%；业务预估价值合计 $119.01 。</p>\n<p>我统计了大半天的 token 使用情况，算出来 20x 的周额度大概也就 1200 刀左右。之前 5.6-sol 能算到 2500 刀左右。\n虽然 6-sol 降价了一半，但是额度也被砍了一半多，而且 6-sol 的 token 平均消耗应该也上升了，综合算下来订阅里的使用量还是少了。\n也收集一下 V 友们的使用情况吧。也能预料到 openai 会不断砍 codex 订阅的额度，没想到这么狠。</p>\n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/额度\"><li></li> 额度</a><a href=\"/tag/订阅\"><li></li> 订阅</a><a href=\"/tag/GPT\"><li></li> GPT</a></P><p><span>23 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-09-24 10:55:07 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18119991\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/75c8/2e17/437058_normal.png?m=1568193512\" alt=\"catning\" data-uid=\"437058\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/catning\">catning</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-23 15:58:32 +08:00\">20h 31m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我 plus 账号看着也是这样的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18120034\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d6ca/4972/312242_normal.png?m=1780449117\" alt=\"Sezxy\" data-uid=\"312242\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Sezxy\">Sezxy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-23 16:07:09 +08:00\">20h 22m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>O\\越来越不行了，我的 plus 都不像续费了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18120048\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/d8e51354c80f463d450612e736f8573e?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"MAVETRICK\" data-uid=\"594960\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/MAVETRICK\">MAVETRICK</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-23 16:10:12 +08:00\">20h 19m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>现在确实应该叫 o 畜了，不过 a 畜也好不到哪去，虽然 claude pro 相比 plus 明显更耐用</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18120100\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4aa7/e521/443609_normal.png?m=1789805781\" alt=\"Yaavi\" data-uid=\"443609\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Yaavi\">Yaavi</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-23 16:19:05 +08:00\">20h 10m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>实测单任务 5.6 sol 极高模式，连续跑 平均一小时降 1%</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18120111\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4aa7/e521/443609_normal.png?m=1789805781\" alt=\"Yaavi\" data-uid=\"443609\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Yaavi\">Yaavi</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-23 16:20:42 +08:00\">20h 9m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>说错了是 6 sol 极高，8 小时用了 8% 没停，没开加速</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18120130\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/4fa6b3cebe56740b5c785c6726625ca4?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"bixinhaner\" data-uid=\"315720\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/bixinhaner\">bixinhaner</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-23 16:25:03 +08:00\">20h 4m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>补充一下 token 维度统计。09:00–15:43 ，业务调用的输入 token 缓存命中率为 93.34%。3,340 次底层调用累计输入约 3.23 亿 token 。<br>这样算下来周额度大约 32-33 亿左右 token ，和之前 5.6-sol 基本持平。</p><p>降价降了个寂寞，等于是 codex 订阅完全不享受降价待遇，O/朝三暮四耍猴技能点满了。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18120163\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d6ca/4972/312242_normal.png?m=1780449117\" alt=\"Sezxy\" data-uid=\"312242\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Sezxy\">Sezxy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-23 16:30:54 +08:00\">19h 58m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>6-sol ，6-luna 大失所望，能力没升，就升了个版本号</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </di